WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Dormant leads don't say no. They just stop answering.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.800
The leads you already paid for sit in the CRM, months cold, with nobody following up. Follow-ups sent: zero.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.500
Context wakes them up. A blast buries them.

00:15.500 --> 00:21.800
The workflow reads the original conversation, writes a specific check-in, and files it as a draft for a human to approve.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
AI drafts. You press send.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.500
Every check-in lands as a Gmail draft with the original context attached. Nothing leaves without a human reading it.
